UUID: 892cf525-c85a-392d-8124-46c326dee3cb
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: No new data for today situation thus assessment with older data and data for Europe.
Production volume: 5.8 TWh from power plants and 0 TWh from combined cycle plants.
Sampling: Literature, environmental reports and questionnaires 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_892cf525-c85a-392d-8124-46c326dee3cb.xml</text>
